 of the document shall be (JPG, PNG not 50KB).&quot;},{&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;align&quot;:&quot;justify&quot;,&quot;list&quot;:&quot;ordered&quot;},&quot;insert&quot;:&quot;\\n&quot;},{&quot;insert&quot;:&quot;The applicant&#8217;s signature shall be kept ready.&quot;},{&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;align&quot;:&quot;justify&quot;,&quot;list&quot;:&quot;ordered&quot;},&quot;insert&quot;:&quot;\\n&quot;},{&quot;insert&quot;:&quot;The copy of aadhaar card shall be kept ready.&quot;},{&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;align&quot;:&quot;justify&quot;,&quot;list&quot;:&quot;ordered&quot;},&quot;insert&quot;:&quot;\\n&quot;}]}</span>\"
